only after Christmas Update 2006. It didn't irradiate light before Christmas Update 2005.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomission\">Gnomission</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomegate\">Gnomegate</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">20,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">Only after slaying 20 Warzone bosses.</li></ol></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Blue Set</li><li>Contest Prizes</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wolf%20%28Mount%29\">Crystal Wolf (Mount)</a></li><li>Decorations</li><li>Did You Know</li><li>Ex